      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, sorry, what do you mean by \"goblins in a suit\"? I'm just trying to get the logistics right for the engineers. Can you just ignore that and finish the Thailand section? I really need the specific requirements for the entry vs transit there so I can finalize this brief.",
